                <pb facs="0601" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v2/pg579"/>

                <head>No. 115.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 25, 1872</date>.
                        (Received at 8 p.m.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Counsel write me regarding the statement sent Schenck for you to-day:</p>
                <p>We concur in the form of communication to the Tribunal of the action of our
                    Government which you propose to make.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
